            </note>
            <note corresp="#d548-f2" n="3" xml:id="d548-f2-content">
                <p>Signed at Washington, January 1, 1942, <ref target="frus1942v01#pg_25">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1942, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p. 25</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d548-f3" n="4" xml:id="d548-f3-content">
                <p>i.e., adherence to the United Nations Declaration.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d548-f4" n="5" xml:id="d548-f4-content">
                <p>Headquarters of the United States Army Forces in Liberia.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
